 * 2. Cart creation with percentage discount promotional codes
 * 3. Cart creation with fixed amount coupon promotional codes
 * 4. Cart creation with multiple promotional codes (stacking)
 * 5. Cart creation with expired promotional codes
 * 6. Cart creation with complex combination offers across multiple sellers
 * 7. Cart creation with invalid promotional codes
 * 8. Validation of promotional code JSON array format
 * 9. Verification of seller participation eligibility
 * 10. Testing of expiration date checking mechanisms
 *
